# Redundant archive (benchmarks/ is tracked directly)
benchmarks.zip
# benchmarks_standalone.zip IS tracked: it is the only way this repository is
# reproducible on its own. benchmarks/ ships importlib shims that re-export the
# real modules from the sibling avoidance_obstacle/sim repo (deliberately -- sim/
# is the shared single source of truth), so a clone of this repo alone cannot run
# the DI planner, TOTG, FR3, dynamic-obstacle or MuJoCo benchmarks. The zip is a
# frozen snapshot with those modules inlined. Rebuild with make_release_zip.py.

